    {
      "_key": "uq3fmz3b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "uq3fmz3bc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Understanding Token Costs"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "dz0ek8zv",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dz0ek8zvc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "AI token costs can vary widely depending on the model and service you're using. Some models charge a fixed rate per token, while others use tiered pricing structures or offer discounts for bulk usage."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "wzjxcr8y",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "wzjxcr8yc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "To manage your AI expenses effectively, it's essential to understand how token costs work and plan accordingly. This might involve setting budget limits, selecting cost-effective models, or optimizing your text processing workflows."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fwhy85ih",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fwhy85ihc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pricing Tiers and Discounts"
